# Build context for Dockerfile and apps/fe/Dockerfile (both built from the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
apps/fe/.git
.github
.cursor
.claude

# Secrets stay out of images; Kubernetes passes them as environment variables.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
